## Folder map

- **`frontend/src/`**
  - **`App.jsx`** — nav + routes; wraps `WrappedPlayerProvider`
  - **`context/`** — `ExportDataContext.jsx`, `WrappedPlayerContext.jsx`
  - **`config/`** — `features.js`, `wrappedPlayer.js` (slide count, durations)
  - **`components/`** — `WrappedLobby.jsx`, `WrappedStoryPlayer.jsx`, `WrappedSlideChrome.jsx`, `WrappedAvatarPodium.jsx`, `ExportPicker.jsx`, `ExportGuide.jsx`; `WrappedStoryDeck.jsx` (**legacy**, unused after Phase E)
  - **`pages/`** — `WrappedPage.jsx`, `wrappedSlideContent.jsx`, `GuidePage.jsx`; legacy analysis pages (not routed)
  - **`utils/`** — `wrappedData.js`, `wrappedInsights.js`, `parseWarningImpact.js`, parsers (`commentHeatmap.js`, etc.)
  - **`lib/`** — `utils.js` (`cn`), `tokens.js`
  - **`tailwind.css`**, **`styles.css`**, **`vite.config.js`**
- **`docs/AGENT_CONTEXT.md`** — rolling handoff (read first for AI)

## Conventions

- Focused diffs; no unrelated refactors.
- **Leaderboard slides:** [`WrappedAvatarPodium.jsx`](frontend/src/components/WrappedAvatarPodium.jsx); `:has(.wrapped-leaderboard)` for overflow/padding on card shell.
- Extend parsers via patterns in **`commentHeatmap.js`** / **`socialInteractionGraph.js`**.
- No new heavy chart libs without approval. Phase H may add **GSAP** (or Framer Motion) for slide timelines — one animation library only.

## API (backend, optional)

- `GET /health` → `{ "ok": true }`
- `POST /upload` — legacy Non-Followers (not in UI)
